   "text": "Gas pipeline for Stargate New Mexico delayed until 2027. It was meant to be done tomorrow. Oracle is not going to be able to make $30bn from its OpenAI contract let alone $300bn. This is on top of them having to start applications again for Stargate Wisconsin. Oracle's screwed!",
